{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25403","headline":"故人寄茶 · 李德裕","name":"故人寄茶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"劒外九华英，缄题下玉京。\n开时微月上，碾处乱泉声。\n半夜邀僧至，孤吟对竹烹。\n碧流霞脚碎，香泛乳花轻。\n六腑睡神去，数朝诗思清。\n其余不敢费，留伴读书行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25403.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25403","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「故人寄茶」条，撰者管遗瑞、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"管遗瑞"}